<header>
 <h1>U.S. Inflation Dashboard</h1>
 <p>Figures below trace directly to federal statistical agencies — click through to verify each number at its origin.</p>
 <div class="asof">Latest official data pulled: July 19, 2026 · includes June CPI (Jul 14), June PPI (Jul 15), weekly jobless claims (Jul 16), and mortgage rates (Jul 16) · Next CPI release: July 2026 data, out August 12, 2026</div>
