 For CPI figures: open the BLS CPI News Release for the relevant month and match the "12 months ending [month]" percentage for each category. For Medicare/Medicaid: open the CMS NHE Fact Sheet or the Medicare Parts A &amp; B Premiums fact sheet and match the dollar figures and growth rates directly. FRED lets you plot any of these series yourself and download the raw CSV for your own analysis.
